### Batch Update API Tests
### Make sure to replace {{jwt_token}}, {{batch_id}}, and {{mentor_id}} with actual values

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002
@jwt_token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@batch_id = YOUR_BATCH_ID_HERE
@mentor_id = YOUR_MENTOR_ID_HERE

### 1. Get all batches (to find a batch ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 2. Get specific batch details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}

### 3. Update venue only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venue": "Building A, Room 101, Tech Campus"
}

### 4. Update capacity only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 100
}

### 5. Update status (Draft → Open)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Open"
}

### 6. Update multiple fields
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "venue": "Online - Zoom Platform",
  "capacity": 150,
  "status": "Filling"
}

### 7. Test invalid status transition (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 8. Test capacity less than enrolled count (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 5
}

### 9. Assign mentor to batch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}/mentor
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mentorId": "{{mentor_id}}"
}

### 10. Transition to Cancelled (always allowed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/batches/{{batch_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}
